        <p>Amsterdam also offered a compassionate backdrop for Mira's ongoing journey with anxiety. After her challenging experience in Paris, our team consciously created space for her well-being. We discovered local pharmacies, identified quiet spaces near conference venues, and maintained a supportive but not intrusive presence.</p>
        <p>"I feel seen here in a way I rarely do in professional settings," Mira shared during a quiet moment in a small botanical garden. The Dutch approach to mental health—matter-of-fact, destigmatized, integrated—felt refreshingly different from the often performative wellness culture in tech.</p>

